          \frac{d}{dx}\left(x\arctan(x)\right)
          \amp = 1\cdot \arctan(x) + x\cdot \frac{1}{1+x^2}\\
          \amp = \arctan(x)+\frac{x}{1+x^2}.
          \end{aligned}</me></p>
